[2026-07-08T01:14:29+08:00][sql] INSERT INTO `ai_dev_run_logs` SET `run_id` = 11 , `seq` = 165 , `event_type` = 'assistant' , `content` = '{\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"id\":\"374b8eaa-0d2b-4a75-a226-fe58897e2ad5\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"model\":\"deepseek-v4-flash\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Here is a thorough analysis of the project structure, covering every aspect requested.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. Project Type, Framework, and Language\\n\\n**Language:** PHP (7.0+ minimum per composer.json)\\n\\n**Framework:** **ThinkPHP 5.0** (`topthink\\/framework ~5.0.24`), a popular Chinese MVC framework, running on top of the **FastAdmin** scaffolding (`karsonzhang\\/fastadmin`, described as \\\"the fastest admin framework\\\").\\n\\n**Key config files:**\\n- `\\/Users\\/hufangfang\\/www\\/local\\/yuanxiao\\/composer.json` -- project metadata, dependencies, PSR-4 autoloading\\n- `\\/Users\\/hufangfang\\/www\\/local\\/yuanxiao\\/package.json` -- trivial, only contains `\\\"name\\\": \\\"yuanxiao\\\"`\\n- `\\/Users\\/hufangfang\\/www\\/local\\/yuanxiao\\/bower.json` -- frontend dependencies (Bootstrap, jQuery, etc.)\\n- `\\/Users\\/hufangfang\\/www\\/local\\/yuanxiao\\/think` -- CLI entry point (console runner)\\n- `\\/Users\\/hufangfang\\/www\\/local\\/yuanxiao\\/.env` -- environment config (database, redis, OSS, ES, queue, external API URLs, etc.)\\n\\n**Database:** MySQL (multiple databases: main `yuanxiao`, plus `yanzhao`, `ucenter`, `document`, `crm`, `cms`, `wenjuan`, `auth`, `cl_php`, `cl_operations_center`, `service_assets`, `service`, `chengla_live`).\\n\\n**Other notable dependencies:** Alibaba Cloud SDK\\/OSS, Elasticsearch 7.11, PhpSpreadsheet\\/PhpExcel, WeChat SDK, PhpMailer, Pinyin, Intervention Image, Redis.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. Directory Structure\\n\\n```\\n\\/Users\\/hufangfang\\/www\\/local\\/yuanxiao\\/\\n    application\\/         -- Main application code (ThinkPHP module-based)\\n        admin\\/           -- Admin backend module (controllers, models, validate, views)\\n        api\\/             -- API module (controllers, validate, logic, library)\\n        common\\/          -- Shared code (base controllers, models, behaviors, library)\\n        index\\/           -- Frontend homepage module (minimal)\\n        task\\/            -- Task\\/console module (data gathering, cron jobs)\\n        extra\\/           -- Extra config files (site.php)\\n        build.php        -- Module auto-generation config\\n        command.php      -- Console command registration\\n        common.php       -- Global helper functions (98KB, huge)\\n        config.php       -- Main application config\\n        database.php     -- Database connections config\\n        route.php        -- Route definitions\\n        tags.php         -- Behavior\\/hook registration\\n    extend\\/              -- Extended libraries\\n        fast\\/            -- FastAdmin helper classes (Auth, Date, Form, Http, Pinyin, Random, Rsa, Tree, Version, Clickhouse, ImageBuild)\\n        org\\/             -- Organizational libraries (Es, EventPush, OssBaseClient, RedisClient)\\n        phpqrcode\\/       -- QR code library\\n    public\\/              -- Web root\\n        index.php        -- Main entry point (includes thinkphp\\/start.php)\\n        yxAdmin.php      -- Separate admin entry point\\n        assets\\/          -- Frontend assets (JS, CSS, libs via bower)\\n        static\\/          -- Static generated images\\n        uploads\\/         -- Uploaded files\\n    runtime\\/             -- Cache, logs, temp files\\n    addons\\/              -- Plugin\\/addon system\\n    vendor\\/              -- Composer dependencies\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3. Route Registration Pattern\\n\\n**File:** `\\/Users\\/hufangfang\\/www\\/local\\/yuanxiao\\/application\\/route.php`\\n\\nThe project uses explicit route rule definitions via `Route::rule()`:\\n\\n```php\\nRoute::rule(\\\"\\/api\\/major\\/user-target\\/list\\\", \\\"api\\/AppMajor\\/targetList\\\");\\nRoute::rule(\\\"\\/api\\/major\\/user-target\\/add-or-del\\\", \\\"api\\/AppMajor\\/addOrDelTarget\\\");\\n\\/\\/ etc.\\n```\\n\\nRoutes map URL patterns to `module\\/controller\\/method`. Explicit routes are registered for only a subset of API endpoints (the `AppMajor` and `User` controllers). Most API controllers rely on the **default URL routing** convention:\\n\\n- `url_route_on` is `true`, `url_route_must` is `false` (route is optional)\\n- `url_domain_deploy` is `true` (domain-based module routing)\\n- Default URL pattern: `http:\\/\\/host\\/module\\/controller\\/action\\/param\\/value`\\n- The `common` behavior in `application\\/common\\/behavior\\/Common.php` disables routing for URL paths starting with `index` or `api`\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 4. Module Organization (ThinkPHP Multi-Module)\\n\\n### Module: `api` -- API Endpoints\\n\\n**Config:** `\\/Users\\/hufangfang\\/www\\/local\\/yuanxiao\\/application\\/api\\/config.php`\\n- Sets `default_return_type` to `\'json\'`\\n- Custom exception handler: `\\\\app\\\\api\\\\library\\\\ExceptionHandle`\\n\\n**Controllers** (all in `\\/Users\\/hufangfang\\/www\\/local\\/yuanxiao\\/application\\/api\\/controller\\/`):\\n\\n| File | Class | Purpose |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| `Base.php` | `Base` | Config fetching, company wechat info |\\n| `Index.php` | `Index` | Homepage, notices, course tasks, wx index |\\n| `School.php` | `School` | School filter, list, detail, introduce, zsjz |\\n| `Major.php` | `Major` | Major-related endpoints |\\n| `MajorSchool.php` | `MajorSchool` | Major-school relationship endpoints |\\n| `Compair.php` | `Compair` | School comparison, major menus, search, images |\\n| `ChooseSchool.php` | `ChooseSchool` | School selection logic |\\n| `ChooseSchoolV3.php` | `ChooseSchoolV3` | School selection V3 |\\n| `Ai.php` | `Ai` | AI-powered school recommendations |\\n| `User.php` | `User` | User assessment, targets |\\n| `AppMajor.php` | `AppMajor` | App major targets (user-target CRUD) |\\n| `Score.php` | `Score` | Score-related endpoints |\\n| `Search.php` | `Search` | Search functionality |\\n| `Plan.php` | `Plan` | Study plans |\\n| `Course.php` | `Course` | Course info |\\n| `Analysis.php` | `Analysis` | Analysis endpoints |\\n| `Fushi.php` | `Fushi` | Re-examination (复试) data |\\n| `YearDetail.php` | `YearDetail` | Year details |\\n| `Yuanxi.php` | `Yuanxi` | College\\/department data |\\n| `Gather.php` | `Gather` | Data gathering |\\n| `Pick.php` | `Pick` | Picking\\/recommendation |\\n| `Roster.php` | `Roster` | Roster data |\\n| `NewsFlash.php` | `NewsFlash` | News flash |\\n| `Test.php` | `Test` | Test endpoint |\\n\\n**Logic layer** (`\\/Users\\/hufangfang\\/www\\/local\\/yuanxiao\\/application\\/api\\/logic\\/`):\\n- `Common.php`, `User.php`, `Course.php`, `Document.php`\\n- `ChooseSchool.php`, `ChooseSchoolV3.php`, `ChooseSchoolChatHandler.php`, `ChooseSchoolConversationGenerator.php`\\n- `Pic.php` (image generation), `Fushi.php`, `MajorSchool.php`\\n- `PlanLogic.php`, `AnalysisLogic.php`, `ProcessManager.php`\\n\\n**Validation** (`\\/Users\\/hufangfang\\/www\\/local\\/yuanxiao\\/application\\/api\\/validate\\/`):\\n- `Auth.php` -- validates API headers (signTime, action, version, nonce, appId, sign)\\n- `ChooseSchool.php` -- validates school selection parameters with custom rule methods and scene support\\n- `Ai.php` -- validates AI-related parameters\\n\\n**Library** (`\\/Users\\/hufangfang\\/www\\/local\\/yuanxiao\\/application\\/api\\/library\\/`):\\n- `ComErrorDescs.php` -- error code constants\\n- `ExceptionHandle.php` -- custom exception handler\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Module: `admin` -- Admin Backend\\n\\n**Controllers** (`\\/Users\\/hufangfang\\/www\\/local\\/yuanxiao\\/application\\/admin\\/controller\\/`):\\n\\n| File | Purpose |\\n|---|---|\\n| `Dashboard.php` | Admin dashboard |\\n| `Index.php` | Admin index |\\n| `Addon.php` | Plugin management |\\n| `Ajax.php` | General AJAX handlers |\\n| `Category.php` | Category management |\\n| `Command.php` | Console command UI |\\n| `External.php` | External links |\\n| `Import.php` | Data import |\\n| `ImportRecord.php` | Import records |\\n| `School.php` | School CRUD |\\n| `Major.php` | Major CRUD |\\n| `SchoolMajor.php` | School-major relationships |\\n| `Admission.php` | Admission data |\\n| `SchoolYjxk.php` | School-discipline relationship |\\n| `YearDetail.php` | Year details |\\n| `YearAdmit.php` | Yearly admission |\\n| `YearYjfx.php` | Yearly analysis |\\n| `Yjxk.php` | Disciplines (一级学科) |\\n| `Yuanxi.php` | Colleges\\/departments |\\n| `BenkeMenlei.php` | Undergraduate categories |\\n| `BenkeYjxk.php` | Undergraduate disciplines |\\n| `TClRoster.php` | Roster management |\\n| `BuyQrcode.php` | Purchase QR codes |\\n| `auth\\/Admin.php` | Admin user auth |\\n| `auth\\/Group.php` | Admin group auth |\\n| `auth\\/Rule.php` | Admin rule auth |\\n| `auth\\/Adminlog.php` | Admin log |\\n| `general\\/Config.php` | System config |\\n| `general\\/Profile.php` | Admin profile |\\n| `general\\/Attachment.php` | File attachments |\\n\\n**Models** (`\\/Users\\/hufangfang\\/www\\/local\\/yuanxiao\\/application\\/admin\\/model\\/`):\\n- `Admin.php`, `AdminLog.php`, `AuthGroup.php`, `AuthGroupAccess.php`, `AuthRule.php`\\n- `School.php`, `Major.php`, `SchoolMajor.php`\\n- `Admission.php`, `MajorSchoolAdmit.php`, `MajorSchoolDetail.php`, `MajorSchoolResearch.php`\\n- `Area.php`, `Platform.php`, `Version.php`, `Command.php`\\n- `Yuanxi.php`, `Yjxk.php`, `SchoolYjxk.php`\\n- `BenkeMenlei.php`, `BenkeYjxk.php`\\n- `TClRoster.php`, `ImportRecord.php`, `BuyQrcode.php`\\n- `AiChoose.php`\\n- `general\\/Attachment.php`\\n\\n**Validators** (`\\/Users\\/hufangfang\\/www\\/local\\/yuanxiao\\/application\\/admin\\/validate\\/`):\\n- `Admin.php`, `AuthRule.php`, `Category.php`, `Command.php`, `Platform.php`\\n- `User.php`, `UserGroup.php`, `UserRule.php`, `Version.php`\\n- `TClRoster.php`, `ImportRecord.php`\\n- `general\\/Attachment.php`\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Module: `common` -- Shared Code\\n\\n**Base Controllers** (`\\/Users\\/hufangfang\\/www\\/local\\/yuanxiao\\/application\\/common\\/controller\\/`):\\n- `Api.php` -- Base API controller with token auth, success\\/error response helpers, validation\\n- `ApiAuth.php` -- **Primary base controller for API module** with signature-based auth (`sign`, `signTime`, `platform`, `version`, `nonce`, `appId`), token login check, and VPN restriction support\\n- `Backend.php` -- Base admin controller with extensive query building (`buildparams`), data permission limits, selectpage support\\n- `Frontend.php` -- Base frontend controller\\n\\n**Models** (`\\/Users\\/hufangfang\\/www\\/local\\/yuanxiao\\/application\\/common\\/model\\/`):\\n- `School.php`, `Major.php`, `MajorSchool.php`, `SchoolMajorCollect.php`, `UserSchoolMajorTarget.php`\\n- `Area.php`, `AreaCity.php`\\n- `Category.php`, `Config.php`, `Attachment.php`\\n- `Ems.php`, `Sms.php`, `Version.php`\\n- `Yuanxi.php`, `Yjxk.php`\\n- `Document.php`, `AccessControl.php`\\n\\n**Behaviors** (`\\/Users\\/hufangfang\\/www\\/local\\/yuanxiao\\/application\\/common\\/behavior\\/`):\\n- `Common.php` -- URL routing logic, template config, multi-language support\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Module: `task` -- Console\\/Cron Tasks\\n\\n**Controllers** (`\\/Users\\/hufangfang\\/www\\/local\\/yuanxiao\\/application\\/task\\/controller\\/`):\\n- `Gather.php`, `EolGather.php` -- Data gathering from EOL (中国教育在线)\\n- `Yx.php`, `Yzdata.php`, `Zldata.php` -- Various data syncing\\n- `Roster.php`, `TjLqrs.php` -- Roster data processing\\n- `SyncHistory.php`, `SyncSchoolId.php`, `SyncSchoolTags.php`, `SyncOnlyTm.php`, `SyncMenlei.php`\\n- `Import.php`, `Export.php`, `ExportData.php`\\n- `Temp.php`, `Test.php`, `TestNew.php`, `TestSecond.php`\\n- `NationLine.php` -- National exam lines\\n- `Esinit.php` -- Elasticsearch initialization\\n- `ExamSubject.php`, `ItemTimesInit.php`\\n- `Repair.php`, `RepairBak.php`\\n- `Common.php`, `Base.php`, `AccessControl.php`\\n- `ChooseSchool.php`, `OrderSchoolAttr.php`\\n- `CreatHotwordsPic.php`, `DocsClickHousePush.php`\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Module: `index` -- Frontend\\n\\n- `\\/Users\\/hufangfang\\/www\\/local\\/yuanxiao\\/application\\/index\\/controller\\/Index.php`\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 5. Middleware\\n\\nThe project does **not** use ThinkPHP 5.0\'s middleware system (there are no `**\\/middleware\\/**\\/*.php` files). Instead, it uses:\\n\\n- **Behaviors** (ThinkPHP 5.0 hook system), registered in `\\/Users\\/hufangfang\\/www\\/local\\/yuanxiao\\/application\\/tags.php`:\\n  - `app\\\\admin\\\\behavior\\\\AdminLog` -- Admin action logging and white-list IP check\\n  - `app\\\\common\\\\behavior\\\\Common` -- URL routing, template\\/CDN config\\n\\n- **Constructor-based initialization** in base controllers (`__construct` -> `_initialize()`):\\n  - `Api` base class: CORS check, HTML filtering, Auth token validation, permission check\\n  - `ApiAuth` base class: CORS check, HTML filtering, signature auth, login check, VPN check\\n  - `Backend` base class: Auth login check, permission check, breadcrumb, config, language\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 6. Validation Patterns\\n\\nAll validators extend `think\\\\Validate` and define `$rule`, `$message`, and optional `$scene` arrays.\\n\\n**Example** (from `application\\/api\\/validate\\/ChooseSchool.php`):\\n```php\\nclass ChooseSchool extends Validate\\n{\\n    protected $rule = [\\n        \'now_standing\'  => \'require|checkNowStanding\',\\n        \'school_id\'     => \'require\',\\n        \\/\\/ ...\\n    ];\\n    protected $scene = [\\n        \'get_score\' => [\'now_standing\', \'school_id\', \'major_name\', ...],\\n        \'get_count\' => [\'area_id\', \'school_attr\', \'major_id\', \'is_full\'],\\n    ];\\n}\\n```\\n\\nCustom validation rules use class methods (e.g., `checkNowStanding`, `checkSignTime`). Validation is invoked in controllers via `$this->validate($data, \'ValidateName.scene\')` (inherited from the base `Api` controller).\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 7. Controller Patterns (API Module)\\n\\nEvery API controller:\\n1. Extends `app\\\\common\\\\controller\\\\ApiAuth` (or `app\\\\common\\\\controller\\\\Api`)\\n2. Declares `$noNeedLogin` and `$noNeedRight` arrays to control access (can use `\'*\'` to allow all methods)\\n3. Returns responses via `$this->success($msg, $data)` or `$this->error($msg, $data, $code)`\\n4. Uses `input()` helper for request parameters (ThinkPHP\'s `input(\'name\', \'default\', \'filter\')`)\\n5. Calls `parent::_initialize()` in overridden `_initialize()` methods\\n6. Uses model instances via `model()` or `Db::connect()` for multi-database queries\\n\\n**Standard response format** (from `ApiAuth`):\\n```json\\n{\\n    \\\"errno\\\": 0,\\n    \\\"success\\\": 1000,\\n    \\\"data\\\": {},\\n    \\\"msg\\\": \\\"success\\\"\\n}\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 8. Main Entry Point\\n\\n**File:** `\\/Users\\/hufangfang\\/www\\/local\\/yuanxiao\\/public\\/index.php`\\n\\n```php\\ndefine(\'APP_PATH\', __DIR__ . \'\\/..\\/application\\/\');\\nrequire __DIR__ . \'\\/..\\/..\\/thinkphp\\/start.php\';\\n```\\n\\nThis loads the ThinkPHP framework bootstrap, which handles autoloading, configuration, route registration, request dispatching, and module\\/controller resolution.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 9. Key Helper \\/ Utility Files\\n\\n- `\\/Users\\/hufangfang\\/www\\/local\\/yuanxiao\\/application\\/common.php` -- 98KB of global helper functions (Excel export, Redis helpers, image building, auth helpers, etc.)\\n- `\\/Users\\/hufangfang\\/www\\/local\\/yuanxiao\\/application\\/api\\/common.php` -- API-specific common functions\\n- `\\/Users\\/hufangfang\\/www\\/local\\/yuanxiao\\/extend\\/fast\\/Http.php` -- HTTP client wrapper\\n- `\\/Users\\/hufangfang\\/www\\/local\\/yuanxiao\\/extend\\/fast\\/Rsa.php` -- RSA encryption\\n- `\\/Users\\/hufangfang\\/www\\/local\\/yuanxiao\\/extend\\/fast\\/Random.php` -- Random string generation\\n- `\\/Users\\/hufangfang\\/www\\/local\\/yuanxiao\\/extend\\/org\\/Es.php` -- Elasticsearch client\\n- `\\/Users\\/hufangfang\\/www\\/local\\/yuanxiao\\/extend\\/org\\/RedisClient.php` -- Redis client\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 10. Summary of Patterns for Adding New API Endpoints\\n\\nTo add a new API route\\/controller, follow this pattern:\\n\\n1. **Create controller** in `application\\/api\\/controller\\/` extending `app\\\\common\\\\controller\\\\ApiAuth`\\n2. **Set access control** via `$noNeedLogin` \\/ `$noNeedRight` arrays\\n3. **Create validation class** in `application\\/api\\/validate\\/` if input validation is needed\\n4. **Create logic class** in `application\\/api\\/logic\\/` for business logic separation\\n5. **Add route** in `application\\/route.php` if custom URL path is desired (otherwise the default `api\\/controller\\/action` pattern works)\\n6. **Add model** in `application\\/common\\/model\\/` or `application\\/admin\\/model\\/` as appropriate\\n7. **Return responses** using `$this->success()` \\/ `$this->error()` from the `ApiAuth` base class\"}],\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":925,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":0,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":72832,\"output_tokens\":0,\"service_tier\":\"standard\"},\"context_management\":null},\"parent_tool_use_id\":\"call_00_PIw8yQqGecc9OjEQ4yQK7431\",\"session_id\":\"eedec3bf-a4f2-4c62-9cdd-51437516f832\",\"uuid\":\"144638dc-3b1d-4d15-8e9b-3da941bff5aa\",\"subagent_type\":\"Explore\",\"task_description\":\"Explore project structure\"}' , `created_at` = '2026-07-08 01:14:29' [ RunTime:0.003566s ]
