oject uses explicit route rule definitions via `Route::rule()`:\\n\\n```php\\nRoute::rule(\\\"\\/api\\/major\\/user-target\\/list\\\", \\\"api\\/AppMajor\\/targetList\\\");\\nRoute::rule(\\\"\\/api\\/major\\/user-target\\/add-or-del\\\", \\\"api\\/AppMajor\\/addOrDelTarget\\\");\\n\\/\\/ etc.\\n```\\n\\nRoutes map URL patterns to `module\\/controller\\/method`. Explicit routes are registered for only a subset of API endpoints (the `AppMajor` and `User` controllers). Most API controllers rely on the **default URL routing** convention:\\n\\n- `url_route_on` is `true`, `url_route_must` is `false` (route is optional)\\n- `url_domain_deploy` is `true` (domain-based module routing)\\n- Default URL pattern: `http:\\/\\/host\\/module\\/controller\\/action\\/param\\/value`\\n- The `common` behavior in `application\\/common\\/behavior\\/Common.php` disables routing for URL paths starting with `index` or `api`\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 4. Module Organization (ThinkPHP Multi-Module)\\n\\n### Module: `api` -- API Endpoints\\n\\n**Config:** `\\/Users\\/hufangfang\\/www\\/local\\/yuanxiao\\/application\\/api\\/config.php`\\n- Sets `default_return_type` to `\'json\'`\\n- Custom exception handler: `\\\\app\\\\api\\\\library\\\\ExceptionHandle`\\n\\n**Controllers** (all in `\\/Users\\/hufangfang\\/www\\/local\\/yuanxiao\\/application\\/api\\/controller\\/`):\\n\\n| File | Class | Purpose |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| `Base.php` | `Base` | Config fetching, company wechat info |\\n| `Index.php` | `Index` | Homepage, notices, course tasks, wx index |\\n| `School.php` | `School` | School filter, list, detail, introduce, zsjz |\\n| `Major.php` | `Major` | Major-related endpoints |\\n| `MajorSchool.php` | `MajorSchool` | Major-school relationship endpoints |\\n| `Compair.php` | `Compair` | School comparison, major menus, search, images |\\n| `ChooseSchool.php` | `ChooseSchool` | School selection logic |\\n| `ChooseSchoolV3.php` | `ChooseSchoolV3` | School selection V3 |\\n| `Ai.php` | `Ai` | AI-powered sch