Zldata.php` -- Various data syncing\\n- `Roster.php`, `TjLqrs.php` -- Roster data processing\\n- `SyncHistory.php`, `SyncSchoolId.php`, `SyncSchoolTags.php`, `SyncOnlyTm.php`, `SyncMenlei.php`\\n- `Import.php`, `Export.php`, `ExportData.php`\\n- `Temp.php`, `Test.php`, `TestNew.php`, `TestSecond.php`\\n- `NationLine.php` -- National exam lines\\n- `Esinit.php` -- Elasticsearch initialization\\n- `ExamSubject.php`, `ItemTimesInit.php`\\n- `Repair.php`, `RepairBak.php`\\n- `Common.php`, `Base.php`, `AccessControl.php`\\n- `ChooseSchool.php`, `OrderSchoolAttr.php`\\n- `CreatHotwordsPic.php`, `DocsClickHousePush.php`\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Module: `index` -- Frontend\\n\\n- `\\/Users\\/hufangfang\\/www\\/local\\/yuanxiao\\/application\\/index\\/controller\\/Index.php`\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 5. Middleware\\n\\nThe project does **not** use ThinkPHP 5.0\'s middleware system (there are no `**\\/middleware\\/**\\/*.php` files). Instead, it uses:\\n\\n- **Behaviors** (ThinkPHP 5.0 hook system), registered in `\\/Users\\/hufangfang\\/www\\/local\\/yuanxiao\\/application\\/tags.php`:\\n  - `app\\\\admin\\\\behavior\\\\AdminLog` -- Admin action logging and white-list IP check\\n  - `app\\\\common\\\\behavior\\\\Common` -- URL routing, template\\/CDN config\\n\\n- **Constructor-based initialization** in base controllers (`__construct` -> `_initialize()`):\\n  - `Api` base class: CORS check, HTML filtering, Auth token validation, permission check\\n  - `ApiAuth` base class: CORS check, HTML filtering, signature auth, login check, VPN check\\n  - `Backend` base class: Auth login check, permission check, breadcrumb, config, language\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 6. Validation Patterns\\n\\nAll validators extend `think\\\\Validate` and define `$rule`, `$message`, and optional `$scene` arrays.\\n\\n**Example** (from `application\\/api\\/validate\\/ChooseSchool.php`):\\n```php\\nclass ChooseSchool extends Validate\\n{\\n    protected $rule = [\\n        \'now_standing\'  => \'require|checkNowStanding\',\\n        \'school_id\'     => \'require\',\\n        \\/\\/ ...\\n    ];\\n    protected $scene = [\\n        \'get_score\' => [\'now_standing\', \'school_id\', \'major_name\', ...],\\n        \'get_count\' => [\'area_id\', \'school_attr\', \'major_id\', \'is_full\'],\\n    ];\\n}\\n```\\n\\nCustom validation rules use class methods (e.g., `checkNowStanding`, `checkSignTime`). Validation is invoked in controllers via `$this->validate($data, \'ValidateName.scene\')` (inherited from the base `Api` controller).\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 7. Controller Patterns (API Module)\\n\\nEvery API controller:\\n1. Extends `app\\\\common\\\\controller\\\\ApiAuth` (or `app\\\\common\\\\controller\\\\Api`)\\n2. Declares `$noNeedLogin` and `$noNeedRight` arrays to control access (can use `\'*\'` to allow all methods)\\n3. Returns responses via `$this->success($msg, $data)` or `$this->error($msg, $data, $code)`\\n4. Uses `input()` helper for request parameters (ThinkPHP\'s `input(\'name\', \'default\', \'filter\')`)\\n5. Calls `parent::_initialize()` in overridden `_initialize()` methods\\n6. Uses model instances via `model()` or `Db::connect()` for multi-database queries\\n\\n**Standard response format** (from `ApiAuth`):\\n```json\\n{\\n    \\\"errno\\\": 0,\\n    \\\"success\\\": 1000,\\n    \\\"data\\\": {},\\n    \\\"msg\\\": \\\"success\\\"\\n}\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 8. Main Entry Point\\n\\n**File:** `\\/Users\\/hufangfang\\/www\\/local\\/yuanxiao\\/public\\/index.php`\\n\\n```php\\ndefine(\'APP_PATH\', __DIR__ . \'\\/..\\/application\\/\');\\nrequire __DIR__ . \'\\/..\\/..\\/thinkphp\\/start.php\';\\n```\\n\\nThis loads the ThinkPHP framework bootstrap, which handles autoloading, configuration, route registration, request dispatching, and module\\/controller resolution.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 9. Key Helper \\/ Utility Files\\n\\n- `\\/Users\\/hufangfang\\/www\\/local\\/yuanxiao\\/application\\/common.php` -- 98KB of global helper functions (Excel export, Redis helpers, image building, auth helpers, etc.)\\n- `\\/Users\\/hufangfang\\/www\\/local\\/yuanxiao\\/application\\/api\\/common.php` -- API-specific common functions\\n- `\\/Users\\/hufangfang\\/www\\/local\\/yuanxiao\\/extend\\/fast\\/Http.php` -- HTTP client wrapper\\n- `\\/Users\\/hufangfang\\/www\\/local\\/yuanxiao\\/extend\\/fast\\/Rsa.php` -- RSA encryption\\n- `\\/Users\\/hufangfang\\/www\\/local\\/yuanxiao\\/extend\\/fast\\/Random.php` -- Random string generation\\n- `\\/Users\\/hufangfang\\/www\\/local\\/yuanxiao\\/extend\\/org\\/Es.php` -- Elasticsearch client\\n- `\\/Users\\/hufangfang\\/www\\/local\\/yuanxiao\\/extend\\/org\\/RedisClient.php` -- Redis client\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 10. Summary of Patterns for Adding New API Endpoints\\n\\nTo add a new API route\\/controller, follow this pattern:\\n\\n1. **Create controller** in `application\\/api\\/controller\\/` extending `app\\\\common\\\\controller\\\\ApiAuth`\\n2. **Set access control** via `$noNeedLogin` \\/ `$noNeedRight` arrays\\n3. **Create validation class** in `application\\/api\\/validate\\/` if input validation is needed\\n4. **Create logic class** in `application\\/api\\/logic\\/` for business logic separation\\n5. **Add route** in `application\\/route.php` if custom URL path is desired (otherwise the default `api\\/controller\\/action` pattern works)\\n6. **Add model** in `application\\/common\\/model\\/` or `application\\/admin\\/model\\/` as appropriate\\n7. **Return responses** using `$this->success()` \\/ `$this->error()` from the `ApiAuth` base class\"}}}' , `created_at` = '2026-07-08 01:14:29' [ RunTime:0.002393s ]
